{"id":"dbeb6e7ed5730d0f","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-modular-group.md","title":"Modular Group","display":"df-modular-group — Modular Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-modular-group","aliases":["58-df-modular-group","Modular Group"],"display":"df-modular-group — Modular Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-sl2z]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-modular-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-modular-group</span><span>Modular Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modular-group — Modular Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c893deb0a1811da\" href=\"?note=5c893deb0a1811da\" title=\"58-df-sl2z\">58-df-sl2z</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})\">\\(SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})\\)</span> (special linear group)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)\">\\(PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\)</span> (defined here; modular group)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}group} \\vdash PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\{B\\in SL_2(\\mathbb Z):B=A\\lor B=-A\\}:A\\in SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}group} \\vdash PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\{B\\in SL_2(\\mathbb Z):B=A\\lor B=-A\\}:A\\in SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Modular group: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma = PSL_2(\\mathbb{Z}) = SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})/\\{\\pm I\\}\">\\(\\Gamma = PSL_2(\\mathbb{Z}) = SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})/\\{\\pm I\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Fundamental domain: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} = \\{z : |z| &gt; 1,\\; |\\mathrm{Re}(z)| &lt; 1/2\\}\">\\(\\mathcal{F} = \\{z : |z| &gt; 1,\\; |\\mathrm{Re}(z)| &lt; 1/2\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Generators: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2 = (ST)^3 = I\">\\(S^2 = (ST)^3 = I\\)</span></li>\n<li>Congruence subgroups: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(N), \\Gamma_0(N), \\Gamma_1(N)\">\\(\\Gamma(N), \\Gamma_0(N), \\Gamma_1(N)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Fractional-linear actions and standard generators are downstream atoms.</li>\n<li>The assertion defines the quotient carrier by explicit equivalence classes, avoiding an otherwise undeclared group-quotient operator.  The induced multiplication on these classes is a downstream structure definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diamond and Shurman, A First Course in Modular Forms</li>\n<li>Iwaniec, Quantum Modular Forms</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sl2z","status":"resolved","id":"5c893deb0a1811da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sl2z]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})","display":false},{"tex":"PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}group} \\vdash PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\{B\\in SL_2(\\mathbb Z):B=A\\lor B=-A\\}:A\\in SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma = PSL_2(\\mathbb{Z}) = SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})/\\{\\pm I\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} = \\{z : |z| > 1,\\; |\\mathrm{Re}(z)| < 1/2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S^2 = (ST)^3 = I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(N), \\Gamma_0(N), \\Gamma_1(N)","display":false}],"bytes":1200,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1616e874e8eb33c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a891b0f45131631a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1e44a603d4403766","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\leq PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)$ (modular subgroup, see [[58-df-modular-group]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-modular-group]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-855","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-modular-group.md|58-df-modular-group]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["5c893deb0a1811da"]}